  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-formula-card\"><header><h3>assuncao-reis-standardization</h3><span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--derived\" data-provenance=\"derived\">curated formula</span></header><div><pre class=\"lens-tex\">\\begin{aligned}\n\\term{standardizedRates}{z_i}&amp;=\\frac{\\term{rate}{p_i}-\\term{mean}{b}}{\\sqrt{\\term{variance}{v_i}}},\n&amp;\\term{rate}{p_i}&amp;=\\frac{e_i}{\\term{population}{n_i}},\n&amp;\\term{mean}{b}&amp;=\\frac{\\term{eventSum}{\\sum e}}{\\term{populationSum}{\\sum n}}\\\\\n\\term{variance}{v_i}&amp;=\\begin{cases}\\term{rawVariance}{a+b/n_i}&amp;\\text{if }a+b/n_i\\ge 0\\\\\\term{poissonVariance}{b/n_i}&amp;\\text{otherwise}\\end{cases},\n&amp;\\term{priorVariance}{a}&amp;=\\frac{\\term{squareSum}{\\sum n_i(p_i-b)^2}}{\\sum n}-\\frac{b}{\\sum n/\\term{count}{m}}\n\\end{aligned}</pre><p class=\"lens-ascii\">z_i = (p_i - b) / sqrt(v_i); p_i = e_i / n_i; b = sum e / sum n; a = sum n_i (p_i - b)^2 / sum n - b / (sum n / m); v_i = a + b / n_i, or b / n_i where that is negative. Sums run over the m valid rows only (unmasked, finite e &gt;= 0, finite n &gt; 0). a is not clamped: a negative a is kept wherever v_i stays non-negative. Rows that are not valid, or whose v_i is not positive, are NaN.</p></div><div class=\"lens-symbols\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.assuncao-reis-standardization-compiled:assuncao-reis-standardization-standardize\" data-value=\"standardizedRates\">standardizedRates · output · standardizedRates</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.assuncao-reis-standardization-compiled:assuncao-reis-standardization-standardize\" data-value=\"rate\">rate · intermediate · rate</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=